Package: vl2ggplot
Title: Translate Vega-Lite JSON Specifications into ggplot2 R Code
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("vega-to-altair", "project", email = "noreply@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Given a parsed Vega-Lite JSON specification, generates a
    standalone R script string that builds the equivalent chart using
    ggplot2 (plus dplyr for data transforms and patchwork for
    multi-view composition).
